      },
      "content": "Automatic restart after voltage failure (made inactive)"
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "id": "txt_0212",
      "reading_order": 290,
      "section": "Automatic control of the compressor operation",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 28.270500000000006,
        "t": 298.7138,
        "r": 275.79690000000016,
        "b": 286.43780000000004
      },
      "content": "Automatic control of the compressor operation",
      "level": 2
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "txt_0213",
      "reading_order": 291,
      "section": "Automatic control of the compressor operation",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 62.2308,
        "t": 279.4198000000001,
        "r": 538.4659000000009,
        "b": 240.84280000000012
      },
      "content": "The regulator maintains the net pressure between programmable limits by automatically loading and unloading the compressor. A number of programmable settings, e.g. the unloading and loading pressures, the minimum stop time and the maximum number of motor starts are taken into account."
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "txt_0214",
      "reading_order": 292,
      "section": "Automatic control of the compressor operation",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 62.2308,
        "t": 233.87980000000016,
        "r": 516.6221000000011,
        "b": 195.30280000000016
      },
      "content": "The regulator stops the compressor whenever possible to reduce the power consumption and restarts it automatically when the net pressure decreases. In case the expected unloading period is too short, the compressor is kept running to prevent too short stand still periods."
    },
    {
      "type": "figure",
      "id": "fig_0060",
      "reading_order": 293,
      "section": "Automatic control of the compressor operation",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 85.397216796875,
        "t": 164.55682373046875,
        "r": 112.98509979248047,
        "b": 139.9122314453125
      },
      "image_path": "figures/figure_0060.png",
      "previous_block_id": "txt_0214",
      "next_block_id": "txt_0215"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "txt_0215",
      "reading_order": 294,
      "section": "Automatic control of the compressor operation",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 143.11,
        "t": 172.25408590000006,
        "r": 532.9716114399986,
        "b": 135.44022159999997
      },
      "content": "A number of time-based automatic start/stop commands may be programmed. Take into account that a start command will be executed (if programmed and activated), even after manually stopping the compressor."
    },
